{"seq":1,"slug":"turborepo-engineering","title":"Turborepo 工程实践：pipeline、hash 缓存与 remote cache","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/build-orchestration/turborepo-engineering","wordCount":1312,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"turborepo-工程实践-pipeline-hash-缓存与-remote-cache\">Turborepo 工程实践：pipeline、hash 缓存与 remote cache</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pipeline</td>\n<td>turbo.json 中定义任务执行规则和缓存策略的配置集合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hash Input</td>\n<td>决定任务缓存是否有效的输入集合（文件内容 + 环境变量）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cache Output</td>\n<td>任务执行后被存储到缓存的产物（文件路径快照）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dependsOn</td>\n<td>声明任务的前置依赖，<code>^task</code> 表示依赖包的同名任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Remote Cache</td>\n<td>将本地缓存同步到云端，在 CI 和团队成员之间共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>persistent</td>\n<td>标记长运行任务（如 dev server），不阻塞其他任务的调度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"turborepo-的核心设计理念\">Turborepo 的核心设计理念</h2><p>Turborepo 是一个专为 JavaScript/TypeScript Monorepo 设计的<strong>高性能构建编排系统</strong>，由 Vercel 团队维护（原 Jared Palmer 开发）。其核心价值在于通过任务级别的哈希缓存和并行执行，将 Monorepo 的构建速度提升数倍至数十倍。</p>\n<p>Turborepo 的设计哲学：<strong>不替代包管理器，不重写构建工具，而是在它们之上提供智能调度层</strong>。</p>\n<p>与 Nx 相比，Turborepo 更轻量：配置文件只有一个 <code>turbo.json</code>，无需学习 generators/executors 等概念，适合追求极简配置的中型 Monorepo。</p>\n<h3 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pipeline</td>\n<td>任务执行规则的集合，定义任务间依赖关系和缓存策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Task</td>\n<td>对应 <code>package.json</code> 中的一个 script（如 <code>build</code>、<code>test</code>、<code>lint</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hash Input</td>\n<td>决定任务缓存是否有效的输入集合（文件 glob + 环境变量）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cache Output</td>\n<td>任务执行后被缓存的产物（文件路径列表）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Remote Cache</td>\n<td>将本地缓存同步到云端，在 CI 和团队成员间共享</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"turbo-json-配置详解\">turbo.json 配置详解</h2><p><code>turbo.json</code> 是 Turborepo 的唯一配置文件，位于项目根目录。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基础-pipeline-配置\">基础 pipeline 配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;https://turbo.build/schema.json&quot;,&#10;  &quot;pipeline&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;src/**&quot;, &quot;package.json&quot;, &quot;tsconfig.json&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [&quot;dist/**&quot;, &quot;.next/**&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;test&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;src/**&quot;, &quot;test/**&quot;, &quot;jest.config.js&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [&quot;coverage/**&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;lint&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;src/**&quot;, &quot;.eslintrc.*&quot;, &quot;*.ts&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: []&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;typecheck&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;src/**&quot;, &quot;tsconfig.json&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: []&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;dev&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;cache&quot;: false,&#10;      &quot;persistent&quot;: true&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://turbo.build/schema.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"pipeline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"package.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tsconfig.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".next/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"test/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"jest.config.js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"coverage/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".eslintrc.*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"*.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"typecheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tsconfig.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dev\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"persistent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"dependson-语法详解\"><code>dependsOn</code> 语法详解</h3><p><code>dependsOn</code> 中的 <code>^</code> 前缀是 Turborepo 的核心约定：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>&quot;^build&quot;</code> 表示：<strong>在运行当前包的 <code>build</code> 任务之前，必须先完成所有依赖包的 <code>build</code> 任务</strong>。这确保了构建顺序遵循依赖图拓扑顺序。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;dependsOn: ^build&quot;&#10;        A[&quot;packages/utils build&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;packages/ui build&quot;]&#10;        A --&gt; C[&quot;packages/hooks build&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; D[&quot;apps/web build&quot;]&#10;        C --&gt; D&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;dependsOn: build (无^)&quot;&#10;        E[&quot;apps/web build&quot;] --&gt; F[&quot;apps/web test&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"dependsOn: ^build\"\n        A[\"packages/utils build\"] --&gt; B[\"packages/ui build\"]\n        A --&gt; C[\"packages/hooks build\"]\n        B --&gt; D[\"apps/web build\"]\n        C --&gt; D\n    end\n    subgraph \"dependsOn: build (无^)\"\n        E[\"apps/web build\"] --&gt; F[\"apps/web test\"]\n    end</pre><p>不带 <code>^</code> 的 <code>&quot;build&quot;</code> 表示：在同一个包内，<code>build</code> 必须先于当前任务完成。</p>\n<h3 id=\"高级-pipeline-配置\">高级 pipeline 配置</h3><p><strong>指定特定包的依赖任务</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;pipeline&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;web#build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;, &quot;generate-types&quot;],&#10;      &quot;env&quot;: [&quot;NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"pipeline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"web#build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"generate-types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"env\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>&quot;web#build&quot;</code> 仅作用于名为 <code>web</code> 的包（匹配 <code>package.json</code> 的 <code>name</code> 字段），可以为特定包设置独立的 dependsOn 和 env。</p>\n<p><strong>环境变量感知</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;pipeline&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;env&quot;: [&quot;NODE_ENV&quot;, &quot;API_URL&quot;, &quot;DEPLOY_ENV&quot;],&#10;      &quot;passThroughEnv&quot;: [&quot;SENTRY_DSN&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [&quot;dist/**&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"pipeline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"env\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NODE_ENV\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"API_URL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DEPLOY_ENV\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"passThroughEnv\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SENTRY_DSN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>env</code> 中列出的环境变量会被纳入 hash 计算，不同环境变量值会产生不同的缓存键。<code>passThroughEnv</code> 中的变量不影响 hash，但会在执行时透传给任务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"哈希机制深度解析\">哈希机制深度解析</h2><p>Turborepo 的缓存能力基于其精确的哈希计算。理解哈希机制，有助于合理配置 <code>inputs</code> 以避免过度失效或遗漏失效。</p>\n<h3 id=\"hash-输入的来源\">Hash 输入的来源</h3><p>一个任务的 hash 由以下因素共同决定：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Hash = hash(&#10;  package 的所有声明的 inputs 文件内容,&#10;  package.json 的 dependsOn 依赖包的 hash,&#10;  pipeline 配置中声明的 env 变量值,&#10;  turbo.json 的 pipeline 配置自身&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Hash = hash(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  package 的所有声明的 inputs 文件内容,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  package.json 的 dependsOn 依赖包的 hash,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pipeline 配置中声明的 env 变量值,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  turbo.json 的 pipeline 配置自身</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>默认 inputs</strong>（未配置 <code>inputs</code> 时）：包目录下所有被 git 追踪的文件（<code>git ls-files</code>）。</p>\n<p><strong>配置 inputs 的意义</strong>：精确指定哪些文件变化会使缓存失效，避免不相关文件（如 README.md）变更导致重新构建：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;src/**/*.{ts,tsx}&quot;, &quot;package.json&quot;, &quot;tsconfig.json&quot;, &quot;!**/*.test.ts&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/**/*.{ts,tsx}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"package.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tsconfig.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"!**/*.test.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>!</code> 前缀用于排除特定文件，使测试文件变更不会导致 build 缓存失效。</p>\n<h3 id=\"查看任务-hash-详情\">查看任务 hash 详情</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 干跑模式，不执行任务，仅显示 hash 和执行计划&#10;turbo build --dry=json | jq &#39;.tasks[] | {task: .task, package: .package, hash: .hash, cacheState: .cacheState}&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 干跑模式，不执行任务，仅显示 hash 和执行计划</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --dry=json</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> jq</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '.tasks[] | {task: .task, package: .package, hash: .hash, cacheState: .cacheState}'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>输出示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;task&quot;: &quot;build&quot;,&#10;  &quot;package&quot;: &quot;@myorg/ui&quot;,&#10;  &quot;hash&quot;: &quot;1234abcd...&quot;,&#10;  &quot;cacheState&quot;: &quot;HIT&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"task\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"package\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"hash\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1234abcd...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"cacheState\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"HIT\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"缓存配置与管理\">缓存配置与管理</h2><h3 id=\"本地缓存\">本地缓存</h3><p>Turborepo 默认将缓存存储在 <code>node_modules/.cache/turbo</code>（根目录）。缓存条目以 hash 为目录名：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"node_modules/.cache/turbo/&#10;  1234abcd.../&#10;    turbo-meta.json    # 任务元数据（执行时间、状态）&#10;    logs/              # 任务日志&#10;    dist/              # 配置的 outputs（dist/** 的快照）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>node_modules/.cache/turbo/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  1234abcd.../</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    turbo-meta.json    # 任务元数据（执行时间、状态）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    logs/              # 任务日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    dist/              # 配置的 outputs（dist/** 的快照）</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"gitignore-配置\">.gitignore 配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# .gitignore&#10;.turbo/&#10;node_modules/.cache/turbo/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .gitignore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.turbo/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">node_modules/.cache/turbo/</span></span></code></pre></div><p>本地缓存不应提交到 git（过大且与远程缓存功能重叠）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"禁用特定任务的缓存\">禁用特定任务的缓存</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;pipeline&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;deploy&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;cache&quot;: false,&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;build&quot;, &quot;test&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"pipeline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"deploy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>部署任务、数据库迁移等副作用任务应将 <code>cache</code> 设为 <code>false</code>，防止被错误地从缓存恢复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"remote-cache-配置\">Remote Cache 配置</h2><p>Remote Cache 将本地缓存上传到云端存储，使 CI 和团队成员之间共享构建产物，大幅减少 CI 构建时间。</p>\n<h3 id=\"vercel-remote-cache-官方\">Vercel Remote Cache（官方）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 登录 Vercel 账号&#10;turbo login&#10;&#10;# 关联当前 monorepo 到 Vercel 团队&#10;turbo link\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 登录 Vercel 账号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 关联当前 monorepo 到 Vercel 团队</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> link</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关联后 Turborepo 自动使用 Vercel Remote Cache。CI 环境中通过环境变量配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# CI 环境变量&#10;TURBO_TOKEN=your-vercel-token&#10;TURBO_TEAM=your-vercel-team-slug\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CI 环境变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TURBO_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">your-vercel-token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TURBO_TEAM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">your-vercel-team-slug</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自建-remote-cache-server\">自建 Remote Cache Server</h3><p>Turborepo 支持任何兼容其 API 的缓存服务器。开源实现有 <code>turborepo-remote-cache</code>（Ducktors 维护）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 使用 Docker 部署&#10;docker run -d \\&#10;  -p 3000:3000 \\&#10;  -e NODE_ENV=production \\&#10;  -e TURBO_TOKEN=your-secret-token \\&#10;  -e STORAGE_PROVIDER=local \\&#10;  ducktors/turborepo-remote-cache\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 Docker 部署</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 3000:3000</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> NODE_ENV=production</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> TURBO_TOKEN=your-secret-token</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> STORAGE_PROVIDER=local</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  ducktors/turborepo-remote-cache</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在项目 <code>.turbo/config.json</code> 中配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;teamid&quot;: &quot;team_myorg&quot;,&#10;  &quot;apiurl&quot;: &quot;http://cache.internal:3000&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"teamid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"team_myorg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"apiurl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http://cache.internal:3000\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"github-actions-集成示例\">GitHub Actions 集成示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: CI&#10;on: [push, pull_request]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  build-and-test:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    env:&#10;      TURBO_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.TURBO_TOKEN }}&#10;      TURBO_TEAM: ${{ vars.TURBO_TEAM }}&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          fetch-depth: 0 # 需要完整 git 历史供 affected 分析&#10;&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v3&#10;        with:&#10;          version: 8&#10;&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 20&#10;          cache: &#39;pnpm&#39;&#10;&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - run: pnpm turbo build test lint typecheck --filter=&#39;[origin/main]&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  build-and-test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      TURBO_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.TURBO_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      TURBO_TEAM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ vars.TURBO_TEAM }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          fetch-depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 需要完整 git 历史供 affected 分析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pnpm'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm turbo build test lint typecheck --filter='[origin/main]'</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>--filter=&#39;[origin/main]&#39;</code> 配合 remote cache，实现只测试自 <code>main</code> 分支以来变更的包，且变更前已构建的包直接从缓存恢复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见性能优化策略\">常见性能优化策略</h2><p><strong>策略一：精细化 inputs 配置</strong></p>\n<p>避免使用过于宽泛的 glob，减少不必要的 hash 重算：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;typecheck&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;**/*.ts&quot;, &quot;**/*.tsx&quot;, &quot;tsconfig*.json&quot;, &quot;!**/*.test.ts&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"typecheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"**/*.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"**/*.tsx\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tsconfig*.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"!**/*.test.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>策略二：合理使用 <code>persistent</code> 任务</strong></p>\n<p>开发服务器（<code>dev</code>）应标记为 <code>persistent: true</code>，告知 Turborepo 这是长运行进程，不阻塞其他任务。</p>\n<p><strong>策略三：并行执行无依赖任务</strong></p>\n<p>Turborepo 自动并行执行无 <code>dependsOn</code> 的任务。对于 lint、typecheck 这类独立任务，应避免添加不必要的 <code>dependsOn</code>，以最大化并行度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Turborepo 是中型 Monorepo 的首选构建编排工具，其设计哲学是&quot;轻量+极速&quot;：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>pipeline + <code>^dependsOn</code></strong> 是 Turborepo 的核心模式，驱动拓扑顺序执行和缓存共享</li>\n<li><strong>精细化 inputs</strong> 是提升缓存命中率的关键，应排除无关文件（测试文件、README）</li>\n<li><strong>Remote Cache</strong>（Vercel 或自建）能让 CI 和团队成员共享缓存，显著缩短 CI 时间</li>\n<li><strong><code>cache: false</code></strong> 用于部署、数据库迁移等有副作用的任务，防止错误的缓存恢复</li>\n<li><strong><code>persistent: true</code></strong> 用于 dev server 等长运行进程，不阻塞其他任务调度</li>\n<li><strong><code>--dry=json</code></strong> 是调试 hash 和依赖关系的利器，应作为日常排查工具</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>本章节相关文档：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"nx-workspace\">Nx 工作空间</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"task-caching-remote\">任务缓存与远程缓存</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Turborepo 工程实践：pipeline、hash 缓存与 remote cache","id":"turborepo-工程实践-pipeline-hash-缓存与-remote-cache"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Turborepo 的核心设计理念","id":"turborepo-的核心设计理念"},{"level":3,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"turbo.json 配置详解","id":"turbo-json-配置详解"},{"level":3,"text":"基础 pipeline 配置","id":"基础-pipeline-配置"},{"level":3,"text":"`dependsOn` 语法详解","id":"dependson-语法详解"},{"level":3,"text":"高级 pipeline 配置","id":"高级-pipeline-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"哈希机制深度解析","id":"哈希机制深度解析"},{"level":3,"text":"Hash 输入的来源","id":"hash-输入的来源"},{"level":3,"text":"查看任务 hash 详情","id":"查看任务-hash-详情"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存配置与管理","id":"缓存配置与管理"},{"level":3,"text":"本地缓存","id":"本地缓存"},{"level":3,"text":".gitignore 配置","id":"gitignore-配置"},{"level":3,"text":"禁用特定任务的缓存","id":"禁用特定任务的缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"Remote Cache 配置","id":"remote-cache-配置"},{"level":3,"text":"Vercel Remote Cache（官方）","id":"vercel-remote-cache-官方"},{"level":3,"text":"自建 Remote Cache Server","id":"自建-remote-cache-server"},{"level":3,"text":"GitHub Actions 集成示例","id":"github-actions-集成示例"},{"level":2,"text":"常见性能优化策略","id":"常见性能优化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"依赖图管理：内部包依赖解析与治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/foundations/dependency-graph-management"},"next":{"title":"Nx 工作空间：项目图、受影响分析与 generators","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/build-orchestration/nx-workspace"}}